# patch 0014: no upstream links in a host build
#
# Why: in the native render server (patch 0010) and the wasm page (patch 0012) the app is drawn
# inside AngAI, a different product: user-visible text and links must not carry the upstream
# project name or open its pages. Host builds get no "Report a bug" button, no Help → Report an
# Issue item, and no link in About; the datasheet links of a part are the user data, left as they are.
#
# files: crates/app/src/lib.rs (the host flag and four gated sites), embedded.rs and worker_app.rs
# (their constructors mark the build). Additive and guarded; a normal desktop build is unchanged.

diff --git a/crates/app/src/lib.rs b/crates/app/src/lib.rs
